tique Cuirass (2,170 gold) as item 5 in the EXP Vengeance Brawler build for Ruby.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/ruby#build-exp-vengeance-brawler\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the EXP Vengeance Brawler build for Ruby.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/ruby#build-exp-vengeance-brawler\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/ruby\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5e:[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$63\"}}]\n64:T8be,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"HowTo\",\"name\":\"How to Build Ruby in Mobile Legends: Roam Catch Frontline\",\"description\":\"Roam setup for drafts that need Ruby as a catch-and-peel frontliner rather than a side-lane bruiser.\",\"totalTime\":\"PT15M\",\"supply\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Thunder Belt\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Antique Cuirass\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"}],\"tool\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Tank Emblem\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Flicker Battle Spell\"}],\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Buy Tough Boots\",\"text\":\"Purchase Tough Boots (700 gold) as item 1 in the Roam Catch Frontline build for Ruby.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/ruby#build-roam-catch-frontline\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy Thunder Belt\",\"text\":\"Purchase Thunder Belt (1,820 gold) as item 2 in the Roam Catch Frontline build for Ruby.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/ruby#build-roam-catch-frontline\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Dominance Ice\",\"text\":\"Purchase Dominance Ice (2,010 gold) as item 3 in the Roam Catch Frontline build for Ruby.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/ruby#build-roam-catch-frontline\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Oracle\",\"text\":\"Purchase Oracle (1,860 gold) as item 4 in the Roam Catch Frontline build for Ruby.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/ruby#build-roam-catch-frontline\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Antique Cuirass\",\"text\":\"Purchase Antique Cuirass (2,170 gold) as item 5 in the Roam Catch Frontline build for Ruby.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/ruby#build-roam-catch-frontline\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the Roam Catch Frontline build for Ruby.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/ruby#build-roam-catch-frontline\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/ruby\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n60:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":29,\"name\":\"Ruby\",\"slug\":\"ruby\",\"title\":\"Little Red Hood\",\"role\":[\"Fighter\"],\"specialty\":[\"Crowd Control\",\"Regen\"],\"lane\":[\"EXP\"],\"tier\":\"B\",\"difficulty\":2,\"releaseYear\":2016,\"stats\":{\"durability\":90,\"offense\":20,\"controlEffect\":90,\"difficulty\":40},\"winRate\":49.62,\"pickRate\":0.32,\"banRate\":0.26,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"aldous\",\"heroName\":\"Aldous\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Ruby is strong against Fighter heroes with high burst damage. She can easily survive their burst with her excellent Regen and Lifesteal abilities. Such as Aldous and Guinevere.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"guinevere\",\"heroName\":\"Guinevere\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Ruby is strong against Fighter heroes with high burst damage. She can easily survive their burst with her excellent Regen and Lifesteal abilities. Such as Aldous and Guinevere.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"wanwan\",\"heroName\":\"Wanwan\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Ruby is countered by Marksman heroes with good Mobility. Because they can easily dodge her 2nd and Ultimate skills. Like Wanwan and Irithel.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"irithel\",\"heroName\":\"Irithel\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Ruby is countered by Marksman heroes with good Mobility. Because they can easily dodge her 2nd and Ultimate skills. Like Wanwan and Irithel.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_2cfc71331f6e2435394bfa44c322405c.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_4b96c75b136290576d849309722d4d20.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"37\",\"heroName\":\"Lapu-Lapu\",\"heroSlug\":\"lapu-lapu\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_8b60cceca5b04e97da7372f12bfeb612.jpg\",\"tip\":\"Ruby ults and stuns, while Lapu ults and bursts.\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"6\",\"heroName\":\"Tigreal\",\"heroSlug\":\"tigreal\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_23a7a603ff9d20074777d52e2eb202f3.jpg\",\"tip\":\"You can cancel his 3rd skill with your 2nd skill or Ult (Gets canceled with any stun). Also, you can interrupt his 2nd skill when he finishes the first charge with your 2nd skill and jump away\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"26\",\"heroName\":\"Chou\",\"heroSlug\":\"chou\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_a3dd4a2b8bd5b8f25a8dd520f2c1c71a.png\",\"tip\":\"His 2nd skill makes him immune to CC and may be a problem if you want to stun him before he stuns and ults you.\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Let's Dance!\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Ruby's skills have a 75% Spell Vamp Ratio (her Basic Attacks cannot trigger Lifesteal). For every 1% HP lost, her Spell Vamp Ratio increases by 1%, up to 150%.\\n\\nAfter each skill cast, Ruby can dash to another location and gain 8-25 Hybrid Defense (scales with level) for 4s (stacks up to 3 times).\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Ruby's skills have a 75% Spell Vamp Ratio (her Basic Attacks cannot trigger Lifesteal). For every 1% HP lost, her Spell Vamp Ratio increases by 1%, up to 150%.\\n\\nAfter each skill cast, Ruby can dash to another location and gain 8-25 Hybrid Defense (scales with level) for 4s (stacks up to 3 times).\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_262dcfb1e67c19e273ac2409098c8b5d.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\"]},{\"name\":\"Be Good!\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Ruby swings her scythe, dealing 280 (+110% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit. She then unleashes a shockwave in the same direction, dealing 140 (+55% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit and slowing them by 40% for 1s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Ruby swings her scythe, dealing 280\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+110% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemies hit. She then unleashes a shockwave in the same direction, dealing 140\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+55% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemies hit and slowing them by 40% for 1s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"4s\",\"manaCost\":\"25\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_3ada6c7426a96d2d9b00fbaf7a0068d4.png\",\"tags\":[\"AOE\",\"Slow\"]},{\"name\":\"Don't Run, Wolf King!\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Ruby swings her scythe around herself twice, each swing dealing 60 (+55% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to nearby enemies, stunning them for 0.5s, and slowly pulling them toward her.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Ruby swings her scythe around herself twice, each swing dealing 60\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+55% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to nearby enemies, stunning them for 0.5s, and slowly pulling them toward her.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"7s\",\"manaCost\":\"50\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_eaf4da37b9211deccc9c0452c0853887.png\",\"tags\":[\"CC\",\"AOE\"]},{\"name\":\"I'm Offended!\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Ruby sweeps her scythe in the target direction, dealing 600 (+200% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit, pulling them toward her, and stunning them for 0.5s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Ruby sweeps her scythe in the target direction, dealing 600\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+200% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemies hit, pulling them toward her, and stunning them for 0.5s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"40s\",\"manaCost\":\"80\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_de4c25c06cc0816c7be8638d52d2dfce.png\",\"tags\":[\"CC\",\"AOE\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-1-2\",\"skillPriorityTip\":\"Max S1 first. Deals considerable damage.\\nYou can combine Flicker with your ult.Use it to chase a low-hp enemy; or to escape\",\"skillPriorityTipRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Max S1 first. Deals considerable damage.\"},{\"type\":\"lineBreak\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"You can combine Flicker with your ult.Use it to chase a low-hp enemy; or to escape\"}]},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"pharsa\",\"heroName\":\"Pharsa\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Ruby works best with heroes who can deal high AOE burst damage. Their skills can deal more damage to enemies who are stunned and pulled by her 2nd and Ultimate skills. Such as Pharsa and Kadita.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"kadita\",\"heroName\":\"Kadita\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Ruby works best with heroes who can deal high AOE burst damage. Their skills can deal more damage to enemies who are stunned and pulled by her 2nd and Ultimate skills. Such as Pharsa and Kadita.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In teamfights, use Ruby's 1st Skill to slow the enemy at a distance, and close in with her Passive dash. Then use her 2nd Skill to stun the enemies in range and use her Ultimate to pull back those who try to escape.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":2910,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_3ada6c7426a96d2d9b00fbaf7a0068d4.png\"},{\"skillId\":2920,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_eaf4da37b9211deccc9c0452c0853887.png\"},{\"skillId\":2930,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_de4c25c06cc0816c7be8638d52d2dfce.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In the laning phase, Use Ruby's 1st Skill to slow down the enemy, and the dash from her Passive to get closer. Then cast Ruby's Ultimate to pull the enemy into melee range and her 2nd Skill to keep them stunned. Finally, spam her Basic Attacks to finish them off.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":2910,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_3ada6c7426a96d2d9b00fbaf7a0068d4.png\"},{\"skillId\":2930,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_de4c25c06cc0816c7be8638d52d2dfce.png\"},{\"skillId\":2920,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_eaf4da37b9211deccc9c0452c0853887.png\"},{\"skillId\":2900,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Ruby build, counter, and strategy guide for Mobile Legends. War Axe + Queen's Wings spike, EXP lane trade rules, peel timing, and flex defense choices.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Ruby is not a pure all-in bruiser, but she hits harder now than her reputation suggests. She is a control fighter who wins by taking short trades, resetting with passive dashes, then dragging the next fight to a pace the enemy backline hates. Pick her when your team needs layered crowd control with a real damage threat behind it from EXP lane, not when the draft is begging for a solo carry.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"ruby\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-05-13\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"exp-sustain-control\",\"name\":\"EXP Sustain Control\",\"roleContext\":\"EXP\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\",\"cost\":700,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"war-axe\",\"name\":\"War Axe\",\"cost\":2100,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"queens-wings\",\"name\":\"Queen's Wings\",\"cost\":2250,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\",\"cost\":1860,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\",\"cost\":2010,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"war-axe\",\"name\":\"War Axe\"},{\"slug\":\"queens-wings\",\"name\":\"Queen's Wings\"},{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"fighter\",\"name\":\"Fighter Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"firmness\",\"name\":\"Firmness\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/firmness.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"festival-of-blood\",\"name\":\"Festival of Blood\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/festival-of-blood.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"brave-smite\",\"name\":\"Brave Smite\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/brave-smite.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"flicker\",\"name\":\"Flicker\"},\"blessing\":null,\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"warrior-boots\",\"name\":\"Warrior Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Use into physical EXP lanes when crowd control is light and early armor decides whether Ruby can hold the wave.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"athenas-shield\",\"name\":\"Athena's Shield\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against one-shot magic burst that can remove Ruby before Queen's Wings or Brave Smite can stabilize the fight.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"antique-cuirass\",\"name\":\"Antique Cuirass\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the main threat is repeated physical skill damage rather than healing, shields, or attack speed.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"brute-force-breastplate\",\"name\":\"Brute Force Breastplate\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when Ruby needs movement speed and control-duration reduction to keep spacing through long objective fights.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default EXP setup for games where Ruby farms War Axe into Queen's Wings, then uses Flicker angles to turn sustain into reliable crowd control.\",\"totalCost\":11040,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"physatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":35,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\"]},{\"key\":\"adaptiveatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.adaptiveAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Queen's Wings\"]},{\"key\":\"spellvamp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.spellVamp\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":18,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Queen's Wings\"]},{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":2650,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Queen's Wings\",\"Oracle\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"physdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":75,\"sources\":[\"Oracle\",\"Dominance Ice\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"magicdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":78,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\",\"Oracle\",\"Dominance Ice\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeedPct\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":5,\"sources\":[\"Dominance Ice\"]},{\"key\":\"cdreduction\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.cooldownReduction\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":30,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Queen's Wings\",\"Oracle\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=ruby\u0026items=tough-boots%2Cwar-axe%2Cqueens-wings%2Coracle%2Cdominance-ice%2Cimmortality\u0026spell=flicker\u0026emblem=fighter\u0026talents=firmness%2Cfestival-of-blood%2Cbrave-smite\u0026flex=warrior-boots.tough-boots%2Cathenas-shield.dominance-ice%2Cantique-cuirass.dominance-ice%2Cbrute-force-breastplate.dominance-ice\"},{\"slot\":2,\"id\":\"exp-vengeance-brawler\",\"name\"