 and extra received healing plus cooldown reduction will decide Ruby's second skill cycle.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"blade-armor\",\"name\":\"Blade Armor\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"antique-cuirass\",\"name\":\"Antique Cuirass\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when a basic-attack marksman has to hit Ruby during Vengeance before your back line can answer.\"}],\"notes\":\"Durable EXP setup for physical-heavy drafts where Ruby is expected to absorb the first hit instead of spending Flicker for the opening catch.\",\"totalCost\":11230,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"physatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":35,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\"]},{\"key\":\"adaptiveatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.adaptiveAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Queen's Wings\"]},{\"key\":\"spellvamp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.spellVamp\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":18,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Queen's Wings\"]},{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":3320,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Queen's Wings\",\"Brute Force Breastplate\",\"Antique Cuirass\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"hpregen\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hpRegen\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":4,\"sources\":[\"Antique Cuirass\"]},{\"key\":\"physdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":93,\"sources\":[\"Warrior Boots\",\"Brute Force Breastplate\",\"Antique Cuirass\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Warrior Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"cdreduction\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.cooldownReduction\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":30,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Queen's Wings\",\"Brute Force Breastplate\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simula