kins/ruby/Ruby-Crescent-Dervish-20250324130503.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Ruby/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Neon Edge\",\"tier\":\"Exceptional\",\"rawTier\":\"Exceptional\",\"tag\":\"Golden Month\",\"tagSlug\":\"golden-month\",\"price\":\"Limited-time Event\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero102911-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/ruby/Hero102911-portrait-20250109154353.webp\",\"splashUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/ruby/Ruby-Neon-Edge-20250324130517.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Ruby/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Powderblue Butterfly\",\"tier\":\"Common\",\"rawTier\":\"Common\",\"tag\":\"Elite\",\"tagSlug\":\"elite\",\"price\":\"MCL Tournament Award\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero293-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/ruby/Hero293-portrait-20220525164934.webp\",\"splashUrl\":null,\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Ruby/Cosmetics\"}],\"lore\":{\"backstory\":\"Ruby is a spirited young warrior who wields an enormous scythe far larger than her small frame would suggest. After her village was attacked by werewolves, Ruby took up the enchanted scythe left by her grandmother (the legendary Red Hood) and discovered she could use its momentum to hook and pull enemies toward her. Her cheerful, almost reckless bravery masks the trauma of losing her home, and she channels her pain into a whirlwind fighting style. Ruby hops across the battlefield with infectious energy, turning the tide of fights with her crowd-controlling hooks.\",\"allies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"paquito\",\"heroName\":\"Paquito\",\"relationship\":\"Mentor who trains her in close combat\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"aldous\",\"heroName\":\"Aldous\",\"relationship\":\"Grizzled warrior who sees her as a reminder of his humanity\"}],\"rivals\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"dyrroth\",\"heroName\":\"Dyrroth\",\"relationship\":\"Abyssal prince whose forces destroyed her village\"